  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Extractives and Development II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Sektorvorhaben Rohstoffe und Entwickung II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Das Sektorprogramm Rohstoffe und Entwicklung ber&#xe4;t das Bundesministerium f&#xfc;r wirtschaftliche Zusammenarbeit und Entwicklung und entwickelt Ans&#xe4;tze f&#xfc;r die deutsche Entwicklungszusammenarbeit im Rohstoffsektor. Das Sektorprogramm arbeitet zu den Schwerpunkten nachhaltige Lieferketten, lokale Wertsch&#xf6;pfung sowie Umwelt und Klima.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Extractives and Development provides policy advice to the Federal Ministery for Economic Cooperation and Development and develops new approaches for German Development Cooperation in the field of mining. Core areas of work include responsible supply chains, local economic development as well as climate and environmental protection.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Extractives and Development provides policy advice to the Federal Ministery for Economic Cooperation and Development and develops new approaches for German Development Cooperation in the field of mining. Core areas of work include responsible supply chains, local economic development as well as climate and environmental protection.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Von der deutschen EZ entwickelte L&#xf6;sungsans&#xe4;tze zur Gestaltung einer nachhaltigen Rohstoffwirtschaft sind in den nationalen und internationalen Politikdialog aufgenommen.</narrative>
  </description>
